nohup: ignoring input
Usage: ./run <command>

Commands:
  install       Install project dependencies
  test          Run test suite with coverage
  debug         Run tests with verbose output
  ingest        Ingest a Hugging Face model into the registry
  list          List all locally ingested models
  search        Search local registry by model name or tags
  reset         Clear all stored models and downloaded files
  <URL_FILE>    Process and evaluate URLs from file
